# A2 Official Site and Facebook Enrichment

## When to Use

Use for every retained Company with a verified official website before any FullEnrich People action. Also use for the conditional official-Facebook Company-contact fallback after the website merge.

## Status

`IMPLEMENTED LOCALLY — LIVE FIRECRAWL/APIFY/WRITE ACCEPTANCE PENDING`

## Purpose

Run the bounded official-site stage before FullEnrich. The agent makes attribution and Person-retention decisions; scripts enforce URL safety, the five-page limit, provider transport, evidence, merging and idempotency.

## Commands

```bash
python scripts/preflight_step11_source_action.py website-preflight.json --output preflight.json
python scripts/build_official_site_plan.py request.json --output site-plan.json
python scripts/firecrawl_official_site_fetch.py site-plan.json --output site-fetch.json
python scripts/extract_official_site_observations.py site-fetch.json --output observations.json
python scripts/build_website_decision_packet.py observations.json --output website-packet.json
python scripts/validate_website_decisions.py website-packet.json decisions.json --output website-validation.json
python scripts/build_apify_facebook_requests.py facebook-input.json --output apify-requests.json
python scripts/apify_facebook_page_contact.py apify-requests.json --output apify-raw-results.json
python scripts/validate_apify_facebook_results.py apify-raw-results.json --output apify-results.json
python scripts/build_company_contact_merge_plan.py merge-request.json --output company-merge.json
python scripts/build_website_people_contact_batch.py website-packet.json website-validation.json --run-id <RUN_ID> --output selected-people.json
```

## Firecrawl boundary

Use only `firecrawl_official_site_fetch.py` for prospect websites. Do not use free-form agent `web_extract`. The script fetches the homepage and at most four same-domain Contact/About/Team/Staff pages using Firecrawl v2 Markdown, HTML and links with `onlyMainContent=false`. `FIRECRAWL_API_KEY` is environment-only. Firecrawl has no credit-cap policy; page usage and receipts are audited.

## Facebook boundary

The Apify Actor may run once per Company, with no retry, only when an official-site page explicitly linked the Facebook URL and Company email or phone remains missing across A1/Twenty and website evidence. Results append to Company fields only. Live execution remains blocked until account/build/rights/financial and positive-result gates pass.

## People and writes

Retain up to two official-site People regardless of role. Preserve exact name/title; role may be unknown. Generic Company contacts never populate Person fields. Missing Person channels may proceed to FullEnrich Contact Enrichment. Company primary values are preserved and distinct values append. Apply only a validated Twenty write plan and require read-back reconciliation.
